{
  "name": "Your Otter to Docketwise Case Notes System - Meetings and Calls",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - IN PERSON MEETINGS RECORDED IN OTTER\n\nOtter finishes a client meeting and we go straight to the Microsoft 365 appointment it belongs to. If the appointment does not name the case, Claude reads the transcript for it.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 1280,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c1e24042-a27b-5145-ae4e-746068b26743",
      "name": "Section - 1 - IN PERSON MEETINGS RECORDED IN OTTER",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - RINGCENTRAL PHONE CALLS\n\nA recorded call arrives with its caller ID. The phone number is looked up against Docketwise contacts, then it joins the same matching gate the meetings use.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9150b43b-25c6-5699-adf8-aaeda05bd1b7",
      "name": "Section - 2 - RINGCENTRAL PHONE CALLS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1380,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - MATCH IT TO THE RIGHT MATTER\n\nOne matter, or nobody guesses. Anything ambiguous goes to a person by email before a single word is written to a file.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "0dea54a9-5db6-5e72-9fac-564b6e7874f1",
      "name": "Section - 3 - MATCH IT TO THE RIGHT MATTER",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2240,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - WRITE THE CASE NOTE\n\nClaude turns the transcript into a case note a paralegal would write: decisions, deadlines, follow-ups. It is posted to the matter in Docketwise.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b8f5c233-f57c-54b5-b066-793a03139336",
      "name": "Section - 4 - WRITE THE CASE NOTE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3100,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - AUDIT LOG AND FAILURE ALERTS\n\nEvery note filed is logged with its source and matter. Anything that errors emails the office instead of disappearing quietly.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "ef8903b5-0d3c-5083-b4b9-a02d8ea4509c",
      "name": "Section - 5 - AUDIT LOG AND FAILURE ALERTS",
